  "project_description": "Provides an Drag & Drop widget for Entity Reference fields. \n\n This allows the user to select an entity to reference using two side-by-side lists. The user selects entities from the left-hand list and moves them to the right-hand list. The entities can also be re-arranged (stored in the field delta) by dragging them around. \n\n Dependencies \n Entity Reference \n\n jQuery Update \n\n Entity API",
